\par\pard\plain \tx0\tx360\tx720\tx1080\tx1440\tx1800\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\fi360\ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Joey, An isolated boy goes on an adventure in his imaginary kingdom to fight his Social Anxiety.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Joey is a middle-school boy with high result of Social Anxiety, he always wanted to have friends and connections, going out to play and be important to someone. One day, he met Chloe, who said that she always notices him going everywhere alone, and wants to be friends with him. Having his first new friends, they goes to all sort of places together, they visited the park, the river, and the bench under a tree by the cliffs. One day, Chloe asked Joey to join her to watch the sunset atop their Apartment, which turns out to be a portal to Chloe\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s world, that is Wintershire.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 In Wintershire, Joey is a Mage, who is introduced to a party of Adventurers, who is trying to navigate their way to defeat the Ice Dragon, who has put their land in endless winter. In Wintershire, Joey and his party faces all sorts of danger, evil beasts, ice golems, evil snowmen. Until eventually they reached a kingdom called Edenfield. A kindom warm and welcoming, and there Joey enjoyed the company of his party, and the festivities of Edenfield.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Until eventually, Chloe told Joey the truth. All of this never existed, she never existed. And told him, metaphicically, that she couldn\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92t argue with thim, she couldn\u8217\'92t say things that he hadn\u8217\'92t thought of, even when she spoke to him at this moment, it was him who still believes that he requires a real connection. So Chloe said her goodbye}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Joey is a Highschool student with Social Anxiety. He was never invited to parties, he is so isolated that even the bullies didn\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92t bully him. But then one day, he met a girl called Murphy, who said that she saw one of his Creative Writing project and was so intrigued. And decided to draw it. She said that she liked his drawing. Joey saw this moment as an opportunity to connect, so at one fateful moment, he asked her to maybe use their skills together, so they decided to make a webcomic.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 In this new world, Joey made so many new friends, there are more Artists, he got a friend who agreed to be his editor, some who goes to events, and some who print and distribute it.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 But his team thinks Joey is cold, there are still numerous occasion where Joey was not invited.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Joey still thinks that he is still unworthy, and that he is destined to not have friends.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 He lashes out to his teams, who then only said that they didn\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92t hate him, it was just that they don\u8217\'92t know how to connect with him.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 And so, Joey had an epiphany}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 The next day, Joey gathered his team, and then invited them to Wintershire. Wintershire is still clouded in endless winter. But with his new Team, they can take on the Ice Dragon}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Battle happened, and so eventually the Ice Dragon is slain}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 They were celebrated as heroes}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Chloe was in one of the spectators}}